We do not issue a clarification. The club chair said what a very large number
of women have been saying since October 2020, and a coalition that expects
patience on this subject can hear it in the register in which it is felt.

Poland 2050 now believes the Left will attack it personally rather than
negotiate, and it is not entirely wrong. [? if ministry_psl_in_cabinet = 1 or
government_party = "psl": PSL, the other cabinet partner resisting the bills,
draws the same conclusion.?][? if ministry_psl_in_cabinet = 0 and
government_party != "psl": PSL objects from outside government, where its
reaction cannot become a cabinet veto.?] What we have bought is the one thing
money cannot: the movement's belief that somebody in this government is not
managing them.

- @poland_event_queue: Let the answer stand

@delay_schedule
