We take the delay and charge for it. The coalition council minutes a date, the
Marshal's office confirms it in writing, and every leader signs — which turns a
gesture of goodwill into a document that can be produced in July.

The organisers are unimpressed and say so. Their position is that a signature
from this coalition has a poor record, and the only honest answer we have is
that we agree and took it anyway.

- @poland_event_queue: File the signed timetable

