The club is told to lower the temperature, the language is walked back, and the
coalition's spring proceeds without an argument about the one subject that
brought several hundred thousand people onto the street four years ago.

Local elections are won and lost on other things. What is spent here is not
measured in April; it is measured in July, when the vote finally happens, and
in whether anybody outside the party still believes we intended to hold it.

- @poland_event_queue: Ask the movement for patience

@konkrety_kwota_wolna_2024
# prose-audit: Grade A — Domański's costing, PSL's ladder and Poland 2050's objection are all on the table before Lewica moves, and each route decides whether the biggest broken konkret is killed by its author or by a partner standing where the author needed somebody to stand.
title: Somebody has to be seen killing konkret four
subtitle: The sixty-thousand-złoty allowance costs 48 billion; the Chancellery is looking for a partner to hold the knife
